# ---------- Secrets (added when preparing this repo to be public) ----------
# Broadened from a bare `.env` so a variant filename cannot slip through: .env.local,
# .env.production, .env.docker and anything else are all ignored, while the committed
# *.example templates stay tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.docker.example

# Service-account and private-key material, wherever it lands in the tree.
**/serviceAccountKey.json
**/*serviceAccountKey*.json
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/*-adminsdk-*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
credentials.json
client_secret*.json

# Firebase scrypt parameters captured during migration — describes how to verify real password
# hashes, so it is not something to publish.
server/firebase-hash-config.json
**/firebase-hash-config.json

# Build output
server/medbill-server
server/medbill-server.exe
server/medbill-server.exe~

